        "nobel_worthiness": "The experimental discovery of the Higgs boson confirmed a central prediction of particle physics and is a major achievement in measurement at unprecedented scale.",
        "attribution": "The discovery was made by two large collaborations, so individual recognition risks substituting leadership for the work of thousands. These names are candidates for representative roles, but the basis for selecting individuals must be especially rigorous.",
