        "nobel_worthiness": "Identifying baryon acoustic oscillations as a cosmic standard ruler gave cosmology a powerful independent way to measure the expansion history of the universe.",
        "attribution": "The discovery depended on major survey teams and complementary analyses; the original observations and the demonstration of the standard-ruler method should be distinguished in assigning credit.",
        "maturity": "The feature has been detected in multiple surveys and used extensively, making its scientific standing strong.",
